 🏛️ Cartique Philosophy

 The Commerce Decision Kernel



Introduction

Cartique is not an e-commerce platform.

It is not a shopping cart.

It is not a pricing engine.

It is not a product catalog.

It is not an order management system.

It is not a warehouse management system.

It is not a payment gateway.

It is not a tax calculator.

It is not a shipping calculator.

Cartique is a **commerce decision kernel**.

It receives commercial intent and produces commercial truth.

Everything else is an implementation detail.



The Problem We Solve

Traditional commerce platforms try to solve every problem.


Products
Variants
Pricing
Tax
Shipping
Inventory
Promotions
Coupons
Customers
Orders
Payments
Fulfillment
Analytics


They become complex.

They become fragile.

They become impossible to change.

Cartique takes a different approach.

Instead of solving every problem, Cartique solves exactly one problem:

> Given what exists and what the customer wants, what is commercially true?



 The Insight

Commerce is not a collection of mutable database records.

Commerce is a compilation process.

The customer expresses intent.


"I want this."


The platform evaluates that intent against business rules and commercial context.


Intent + Context → Truth


The result is not a modified configuration.

The result is a new object describing commercial truth.


Truth


Nothing inside the original intent changes.

Intent remains immutable.

Truth is computed.



 The Architecture

Cartique has four layers.


Persistence
        │
        ▼
Commerce Model
        │
        ▼
Resolution Engine
